  "description": "Bounded provider-native offline acquisition facts. Runtime additionally enforces the 16 MiB bound, timestamps, provider/map/surface and immutable revision bindings, unique revision metadata, contiguous page ordinals and explicit rerun proof scope. Canonical output flattens pages, sorts and deduplicates identical facts. Evidence links are acquisition claims, not provider signatures."
